  "text": "Which leads to Pillar Six: observability, evals, and evolving your harness over time. You cannot debug a production harness by reading only its final answer. Serious teams log complete structured trajectories for every run: full prompt snapshots, tool call arguments, exit codes, wall-clock latency, cache hit ratios, and token costs. When something goes wrong, or when you want to see why a five-turn trace fixed our authentication bug in seconds instead of minutes, you can inspect and replay the exact trajectory step by step like a flight recorder.",
